config BR2_PACKAGE_STATIME
	bool "statime (inferno-dev fork)"
	depends on BR2_USE_MMU # Rust
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UCODE
	help
	  PTP daemon (fork with PTPv1 / inferno support), required by inferno.
	  Pinned commit from the inferno-dev branch. Ships ptp-monitor
	  (ucode: bridges the usrvclock export to ubus and procd hotplug),
	  the procd init scripts and uci defaults; boards override the
	  defaults via their rootfs overlay where needed.

	  https://github.com/teodly/statime (fork of pendulum-project/statime)
